'''''Scabiosa triandra''''' is a [[species]] of [[scabious]] belonging to the family [[Caprifoliaceae]].<ref>[https://www.biolib.cz/en/taxon/id1083228/ Biolib]</ref>

==Description==
''Scabiosa triandra'' can grow up to {{convert|1|m}} in height. Flowering period extends from June to September.<ref name=fa>[http://www.infoflora.ch/it/flora/2181-scabiosa-triandra.html Info Flora]</ref><ref>[http://luirig.altervista.org/flora/taxa/index1.php?scientific-name=scabiosa+triandra Luirig Altervista]</ref>

[[File:Caprifoliaceae - Scabiosa triandra.JPG|thumb|Flower of ''Scabiosa triandra'' at the [[Civico Orto Botanico di Trieste]]]]

==Distribution==
This species can be found in Southern Europe.<ref name=fa/>

